84db0be; tests only, no src change): full suite green twice in the foreground
(6189 passed, 102 skipped, 0 failed) and green under the background/SIG_IGN
launcher; that same background harness gave 3 failures on master (the target
test, test_long_lived_caller..., test_outer_pidfd...). All 11 named family
members pass.

RESIDUAL: test_outer_pidfd_is_owned_before_delivered_sigint still fails about 1
full-suite run in 4, needing full-suite context; instrumented in-suite it shows
the planted SIGINT delivered and consumed with nothing left pending and no
exception raised, which rules out timeouts, mask leakage and ambient
